WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Workspace settings. Name, icon and colour, default view, status names, tags, templates, data, webhooks and the danger zone.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: make it yours; match your process.

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.710
Workspace settings: jump links to every section.

4
00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:13.330
Give the workspace an icon…

5
00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:15.170
…on a colour. It shows in the sidebar.

6
00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:16.750
Choose the view new projects open in.

7
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.990
Rename statuses to match how your team talks…

8
00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:22.720
…and save. The names apply everywhere.

9
00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:28.720
Save names is disabled: Two statuses have the same name (case doesn't matter). Make them different. I don't see Space or Danger zone: They're for team workspaces, and Danger zone is for owners.

10
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:33.220
Emoji icon on a colour
